{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleIntro.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hi, I'm KoKo. I'm the new order picker at AmaZoo.\u00a0</strong>My job is to get these boxes to the right place\u2014or at least, I <i>think</i> it is. I don\u2019t have all the instructions yet, and there are some dangerous things around here that I\u2019m not too sure about. <strong>Can you help me move all these boxes and find the way out?</strong> I really can\u2019t wait for this long day to be over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleGameplay.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/giff_gameplay_Steam.gif?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AmaZoo is a progressive and varied puzzle game inspired by the classic Sokoban, reimagined with a side-view perspective reminiscent of old-school 2D games.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy an intuitive and engaging experience as you solve over 100 puzzles across multiple stages, each carefully crafted to challenge your logical thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to <strong>move and organize various types of boxes to clear the way to the exit and advance to the next stage</strong>. But beware\u2014some boxes have unexpected behaviors, and one wrong move can quickly turn a simple task into a tricky challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleBoxes.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/boxes.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several types of \u2018boxes\u2019 in the game, each with unique characteristics and mechanisms. As KoKo, you\u2019ll need to use your skills to <strong>carry, drop, throw, stack, jump, and climb with the boxes in hand</strong>. And if one gets in your way or drives you crazy, <strong>don\u2019t hesitate to kick it out of your path!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleTrap.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AmaZoo\u2019s warehouses are anything but safe</strong>\u2014definitely not up to humanoid safety standards. You\u2019ll encounter towering staircases, compactors, faulty machinery, spikes, lasers, and even explosive hazards. <strong>Be careful, KoKo\u2014workplace accidents are just around the corner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleExperience.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t let the calm atmosphere fool you\u2014<strong>progression brings increasingly challenging puzzles designed to push your logic and creativity to the limit.</strong> Will you rise to the occasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy a challenge, you can replay levels to beat your own record! <strong>But remember: optimizing your work is key.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Probation Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/60f14f200385102c958b68753939c8b923770134.jpg"},{"name":"Employee of the week","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/b4bbb2895671bfff2cd6a94b9f289fe1117acc03.jpg"},{"name":"Employee of the month","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/a4e38665cebbf1324a8e34bb35b879627595a712.jpg"},{"name":"Employee of the year","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/1182423db019bbf730bb93dbac1def6d7f54a157.jpg"},{"name":"Welcome To AmaZoo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/5983d996b3d232a3437ef9cc496c9908ec593b82.jpg"},{"name":"Burn out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/ce1affab638755c3f0a8b235639300d1b057643d.jpg"},{"name":"Workaholic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/6f08c2f065dcd5b2ad3e88b78092d5f9bfece94e.jpg"},{"name":"The Kickmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/410465db734f40e5f727795740c534402a59983e.jpg"},{"name":"Explosive Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/2986ec6a280e2722499234f648545ce23389fc0d.jpg"},{"name":"The Rolling Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3066360/a4733eb6cd5cb167c7a09873346b850d4b101d8e.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3066360?t=1745228866","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745228866","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/8ad7d95fb6a3fa5a837532d7e68b6e0e88d59d32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745228866","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/8ad7d95fb6a3fa5a837532d7e68b6e0e88d59d32/capsule_184x6