rong>. But beware\u2014some boxes have unexpected behaviors, and one wrong move can quickly turn a simple task into a tricky challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleBoxes.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/boxes.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are several types of \u2018boxes\u2019 in the game, each with unique characteristics and mechanisms. As KoKo, you\u2019ll need to use your skills to <strong>carry, drop, throw, stack, jump, and climb with the boxes in hand</strong>. And if one gets in your way or drives you crazy, <strong>don\u2019t hesitate to kick it out of your path!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleTrap.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>AmaZoo\u2019s warehouses are anything but safe</strong>\u2014definitely not up to humanoid safety standards. You\u2019ll encounter towering staircases, compactors, faulty machinery, spikes, lasers, and even explosive hazards. <strong>Be careful, KoKo\u2014workplace accidents are just around the corner!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/extras/EN-titleExperience.png?t=1745228866\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t let the calm atmosphere fool you\u2014<strong>progression brings increasingly challenging puzzles designed to push your logic and creativity to the limit.</strong> Will you rise to the occasion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you enjoy a challenge, you can replay levels to beat your own record! <strong>But remember: optimizing your work is key.</strong></p>","developers":["Turbo Soda Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3066360/header.jpg?t=1745228866","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257060785,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060785/movie480.mp4?t=1737888205","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060785/movie_max.mp4?t=1737888205"},"name":"AmaZoo Trailer Demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257060785/e886615cb0f781e363188051cc9e7692d6e93051/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737888205","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060785/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1737888205","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060785/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1737888205"}}],"name":"AmaZoo","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"AmaZoo - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$12.49</span> $6.24 USD","packageid":1089704,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-50% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":624}],"title":"Buy AmaZoo"}],"packages":[1089704],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requi